e images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-07.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-07.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-07.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-08.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-08.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-08.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-09.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-09.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-09.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-10.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-10.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-10.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-11.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-11.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-11.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-12.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-12.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-12.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"703\" alt=\"Studio Ghibli free images\" /></p>\n\n<p>Well this is just wonderful: Studio Ghibli has uploaded hundreds of high-resolution still images from almost all of their films, including all of the major ones: <a href=\"https://www.ghibli.jp/works/mononoke/\">Princess Mononoke</a>, <a href=\"https://www.ghibli.jp/works/chihiro/\">Sprited Away</a>, <a href=\"https://www.ghibli.jp/works/totoro/\">My Neighbor Totoro</a>, <a href=\"https://www.ghibli.jp/works/kimitachi/\">The Boy and the Heron</a>, <a href=\"https://www.ghibli.jp/works/howl/\">Howl’s Moving Castle</a>, etc. etc. The images are labeled “solely for personal use by individual fans to further enjoy Studio Ghibli films” and people are urged to “please feel free to use the images within the bounds of common sense”.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ghibli.jp/works\">Head to the list of Ghibli movies</a> and click through to each film to find &amp; download the stills. (via <a href=\"https://www.openculture.com/2020/09/studio-ghibli-puts-online-400-images-from-eight-classic-films.html\">open culture</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/movies\">movies</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Studio%20Ghibli\">Studio Ghibli</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/04/hundreds-of-free-images-from-studio-ghibli-films\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"789554fb28b6f45a7c265db5979f98ed196891586728475611cbcf3edca673ee","category":"Sites"}